5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Since we've grown to five people, the old three-person split is clearly outdated. I suggest we look at the data before deciding.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,I agree! Let's make it fair for everyone. I want to see how other houses do it.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,It would be wise to see if the current distribution is actually equitable or if some are carrying others.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I think we need to understand the annual fluctuations and the costs of any physical changes to the house.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,I just hope we can find a way that doesn't make everyone grumpy when the bills arrive.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mio, which specific things are you curious about? I'm interested in the actual room-by-room usage.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mio,,I want to see that reconciliation template and how other houses settle their monthly bills!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I'll look into the payment logs and the plug-in monitor readings to see the actual usage gaps.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I will check the last twelve statements and the electrician's quote for any installations.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I'll look at the kitchen notice and the payment log too, to see if people are upset.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I'll add the sunlight and heating needs to my list. It affects how much we use.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
