60,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"We have three options: a flat monthly split, a seasonal fixed rate, or per-room metering. I prefer the seasonal rate.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Mio,,Metering sounds like too much work for the person in charge. I vote for the seasonal fixed rate!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Metering is the most fair, but the payment logs show we can't handle the conflict. I'll go with the seasonal rate.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"Given the installation costs and the volatility of the statements, the seasonal fixed rate is the most rational choice.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Minato,,I vote for the seasonal fixed rate because it sounds the most peaceful.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,It seems we are in total agreement.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Mio,,Yay! No more monthly math headaches!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,It is a fair compromise between absolute precision and social harmony.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Victoria,,It provides the predictability I need for my budget.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Minato,,I'm happy we all agree.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
